Caller-owned/outside-repo paths, symlinked `/tmp` parents, `..` through real dirs, case-variant roots, trailing-space roots, subdirectory `--repo`, aliases into/out of checkouts, and the git-unavailable fallback are all correctly preserved and well-tested. Unix vs Windows `..` semantics are handled by parameterizing `dotDotIsLexical` (437-463, 894-914) and pinned by a host-truth test (926-954). TOCTOU on the destination is genuinely closed by the pin-and-verify open (995-1104), and the race test (1650-1697) can only false-pass, never false-fail. Test adequacy is unusually high.

